part asks_d07
  tally 2
  note "D-07 · The floor, as of and as known 2026-09-30. The balances are the exports' balance-after figures records.tally writes (readings); the low days themselves can't be found without every row (O:D-1)."

ask d07_check_credits: check observed(redeem_pay[r]).cash.amount == red_net[r] for r in redemption law 2026-09-30

ask d07_check_hr2: check count(s in isb_series where hr2_n[r, s] != red_n[r, s]) == 0 for r in redemption law 2026-09-30

ask d07_check_net: check red_net[r] == red_net_stated[r] for r in redemption law 2026-09-30

ask d07_check_tax: check red_tax[r] == red_tax_stated[r] for r in redemption law 2026-09-30

ask d07_left: sum(held[s, 2026-09-30] for s in isb_series) law 2026-09-30

ask d07_low_balances: bal(konto, d) for d in [2025-06-13, 2025-06-19, 2025-07-03, 2026-03-03] law 2026-09-30

ask d07_lowest: bal(konto, 2025-06-17) law 2026-09-30

ask d07_redemptions: red_day[r], red_paid_on[r], red_tax[r], red_net[r] for r in redemption law 2026-09-30

ask d07_series: red_n[r, s] for r in redemption, s in isb_series where red_n[r, s] > 0 law 2026-09-30

ask d07_one_at_a_time: check count(t in redemption where red_day[t] > red_day[r] and red_day[t] <= red_paid_on[r]) == 0 for r in redemption law 2026-09-30
